Echo "=== A: DHCP config, PrismNet START, hosts file"
MakeDir ENV:PrismNet
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/dhcp ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
C:PrismNet START
DH0:PrismNet/bsdtest LOOKUP=slirpgw EXPECT=10.0.2.2 REVERSE
C:PrismNet STOP
Echo "=== B: static config"
Delete ENV:PrismNet/interfaces/#? ENV:PrismNet/~(interfaces) QUIET
MakeDir ENV:PrismNet
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/static ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
C:PrismNet START
DH0:PrismNet/bsdtest
C:PrismNet STOP
Echo "=== C: auto-start (no core running, OpenLibrary starts it)"
C:PrismNet STATUS
DH0:PrismNet/bsdtest
C:PrismNet STATUS
C:PrismNet STOP
Echo "=== D: AUTOSTART=NO"
Echo "AUTOSTART=NO" >ENV:PrismNet/startup
DH0:PrismNet/bsdtest
Delete ENV:PrismNet/interfaces/#? ENV:PrismNet/~(interfaces) QUIET
